<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-5862] Fix jobScheduler when resourceGroup is enabled</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5862</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The new version of the scheduler does not take into account resource group isolation, leading to the possibility of scheduling tasks across resource groups.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13585006">KYLIN-5862</key>
            <summary>Fix jobScheduler when resourceGroup is enabled</summary>
