                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17865867" author="JIRAUSER294653" created="Mon, 15 Jul 2024 04:46:02 +0000"  >&lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;DevDesign&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Dev Design&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When the slave node pulls tasks, it first retrieves the list of projects that the current node has permission to schedule, based on the resource group configuration. It then filters the tasks based on these projects. If the list of permitted projects includes all projects, no filtering is applied.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
